                <head>No. 12.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram at 10 o’clock p. m., <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-12">February 12,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harvey, Minister United States, Lisbon:</hi></p>
                <p>Has the Sacramento started? Captain Craven expects ber at Corunna.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
